<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela bolivar ends flat at 484.50/485.50/dlr.</title>
<headline>Venezuela bolivar ends flat at 484.50/485.50/dlr.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar closed broadly flat at 484.50/485.50 per dollar in quiet, balanced trade, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;It was absolutely tranquil, with little offered and little demanded from the market,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>The unit closed Wednesday at 484.75/485.50 per dollar.</p>
<p>((-- Ana Isabel Martinez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
